で画面で、真ん中はタイマーと、下X
On the screen, the timer is in the middle, and X is below

147
00:09:12,508 --> 00:09:14,208
書いてます。
is written.

148
00:09:35,008 --> 00:09:38,208
え？え？
Huh? Huh?

149
